<h1 style="color: #1B3B6F;">Blocked Bot Sign-up Attempt</h1>

<p>A sign-up attempt on <strong>TourneyPing</strong> was blocked by bot detection.</p>

<table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0; background-color: #fff;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f8f9fa; font-weight: bold; width: 120px;">Email used</td>
    <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><%= @email.presence || "(blank)" %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f8f9fa; font-weight: bold;">Reason</td>
    <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><%= @reason %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f8f9fa; font-weight: bold;">IP address</td>
    <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><%= @ip %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f8f9fa; font-weight: bold;">User agent</td>
    <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><%= @user_agent %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f8f9fa; font-weight: bold;">Attempted at</td>
    <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><%= @attempted_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p %Z") %></td>
  </tr>
</table>

<hr style="margin: 30px 0;">

<p style="color: #666; font-size: 12px;">
  This is an automated notification from TourneyPing. No account was created.
</p>
